        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "床前明月光：明亮的月光照在床前。", "emphasize": [{"start": 0, "end": 5}] },
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "疑是地上霜：好像是地上结了一层白霜。", "emphasize": [{"start": 4, "end": 8}] },
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "举头望明月：抬起头，望着天上的明月。", "emphasize": [{"start": 0, "end": 2}] },
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "低头思故乡：低下头，思念起远方的故乡。", "emphasize": [{"start": 4, "end": 8}] }
      ]
